{title: Lift up the name of Jesus, shout}

{comment: Chorus}
Lift up the name of Jesus, shout it everywhere you go
Lift up the name of Jesus, gotta let the whole world know
He said if I be lifted up, I’ll draw all men unto me
Come on and lift Him up, lift Him up
He said if I be lifted up, I’ll draw all men unto me
Come on and lift Him up, lift Him up

{comment: Verse 1}
If you’ve got a mountain, you just can’t tunnel through
Trust God to deliver, I know He’ll see you through

{comment: Verse 2}
If your situation has pressed you to the wall
Trust God to deliver, He answers every time you call

{comment: Verse 3}
Deaf ears will be opened, the blinded eyes will
Chains will be broken, and we’ll have liberty
